asr-000359
01:25:41.060 --> 01:25:46.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: The idea then was God works in mysterious ways.

asr-000360
01:25:46.060 --> 01:25:50.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So 2008 or 2009, I visited the UK.

asr-000361
01:25:50.060 --> 01:25:57.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: A very good finance person and ambassador, Ambassador Espiritu, entertained me.

asr-000362
01:25:57.060 --> 01:26:03.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: His joke was that he was fired because of GMA after I visited him.

asr-000363
01:26:03.060 --> 01:26:07.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: He brought in a couple of young people.

asr-000364
01:26:07.060 --> 01:26:09.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And realistically, if you saw them,

asr-000365
01:26:09.060 --> 01:26:13.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: maybe one looked very Filipino.

asr-000366
01:26:13.060 --> 01:26:18.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Two, may hint ka na tatay, nanay, lola nito Pilipino.

asr-000367
01:26:18.060 --> 01:26:23.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yung tatlo akala mo Indian, British Indian.

asr-000368
01:26:23.060 --> 01:26:27.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yung isa akala mo Chinese, British.

asr-000369
01:26:27.060 --> 01:26:30.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But all of them had Filipino blood.

asr-000370
01:26:30.060 --> 01:26:31.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Then he said to me,

asr-000371
01:26:31.060 --> 01:26:36.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Senator, these are the ones who have money.

asr-000372
01:26:36.060 --> 01:26:38.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Because they are the grandchildren.

asr-000373
01:26:38.060 --> 01:26:43.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So yung migrants, yung lola nila, nurses, engineers,

asr-000374
01:26:43.060 --> 01:26:45.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: may [unclear] diyan.

asr-000375
01:26:45.060 --> 01:26:47.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Talagang lahat ng klaseng hirap.

asr-000376
01:26:47.060 --> 01:26:52.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero yung magulang nila nakapag-aral na sa mga UK schools,

asr-000377
01:26:52.060 --> 01:26:53.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: British universities,

asr-000378
01:26:53.060 --> 01:26:55.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: with a good salary.

asr-000379
01:26:55.060 --> 01:26:58.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But these ones, they are in the top schools.

asr-000380
01:26:58.060 --> 01:27:01.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At yung mga graduate nito, pinag-aagawan na.

asr-000381
01:27:01.060 --> 01:27:02.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So they are in good company.

asr-000382
01:27:02.060 --> 01:27:06.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But most of them have never visited the Philippines.

asr-000383
01:27:06.060 --> 01:27:08.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So he wanted to point out,

asr-000384
01:27:08.060 --> 01:27:10.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: he thought of a program.

asr-000385
01:27:10.060 --> 01:27:12.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: He said, yes, it's a good program.

asr-000386
01:27:12.060 --> 01:27:14.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Let's say in Hong Kong,

asr-000387
01:27:14.060 --> 01:27:17.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: if your boss wants to join,

asr-000388
01:27:17.060 --> 01:27:19.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: it's a plus one visitor.

asr-000389
01:27:19.060 --> 01:27:21.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And Hong Kong is just nearby.

asr-000390
01:27:21.060 --> 01:27:23.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Or if you're an engineer in Saudi,

asr-000391
