Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: and you want to sell a different vacation spot from the usual,

asr-000392
01:27:31.060 --> 01:27:33.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Eh marami din namang Muslim Filipino,

asr-000393
01:27:33.060 --> 01:27:35.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: so kino-consider din.

asr-000394
01:27:35.060 --> 01:27:37.060
