asr-000891
02:00:19.460 --> 02:00:27.680
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Ang projections po namin, nakuha namin sa Department of Tourism po at data from Singapore and Thailand po.

asr-000892
02:00:27.680 --> 02:00:36.260
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: 1.5 million po ang nakuha po ng Singapore Expo last year.

asr-000893
02:00:36.780 --> 02:00:43.440
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: And Singapore Expo is only 120,000 square meters.

asr-000894
02:00:44.060 --> 02:00:50.640
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: And Thailand which is 240,000 square meters, nakakuha po ng 1.2 million.

asr-000895
02:00:50.760 --> 02:00:53.340
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Of course, these are developed, we cannot compare.

asr-000896
02:00:53.880 --> 02:00:57.200
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: So we go at a very low level sa umpisa po.

asr-000897
02:00:57.200 --> 02:01:05.000
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Kasi 140,000 po ang makakuha lang tayo ng isa o dalawang event na kalahati po noon.

asr-000898
02:01:05.120 --> 02:01:07.220
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Di 140,000 tourists na po.

asr-000899
02:01:07.820 --> 02:01:12.460
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Spending at an average of 30,000, malaki na po.

asr-000900
02:01:13.580 --> 02:01:21.840
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: So, this will be the largest in Southeast Asia with 243,000 square meters.

asr-000901
02:01:22.220 --> 02:01:25.660
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: And we would like to thank the President for his vision.

asr-000902
02:01:26.440 --> 02:01:26.840
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: In thinking of...

asr-000903
02:01:27.200 --> 02:01:29.180
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: To engage in MICE.

asr-000904
02:01:29.720 --> 02:01:32.960
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: So, at least we are thinking big in economics.

asr-000905
02:01:33.240 --> 02:01:39.880
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: So, it aims to represent the country as a nation that is international in its outlook and ambitions

asr-000906
02:01:39.880 --> 02:01:45.320
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: with a desire to engage with the global community and foster connection.

asr-000907
02:01:46.380 --> 02:01:54.640
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: The PIEC aims to be a catalyst, not only of MICE events, but a meeting place to showcase not only Philippine products,

asr-000908
02:01:54.840 --> 02:01:57.180
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: culture, arts, history, and culture.

asr-000909
02:01:57.200 --> 02:02:09.260
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: But also the Philippines' plan to position itself as a meeting place and trading center of Asian products, culture, people, history, and tradition.

asr-000910
02:02:09.960 --> 02:02:20.780
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: The PIEC being the biggest exhibition center in Southeast Asia and having the cheapest cost, skilled labor, friendly and English-speaking population,

asr-000911
02:02:20.780 --> 02:02:26.780
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: and cheap booth construction, and cost to produce.

asr-000912
02:02:27.200 --> 02:02:37.880
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: These events, for MICE events, among countries with big exhibition center, enhances the reputation of our Southeast Asia.

asr-000913
02:02:38.880 --> 02:02:57.180
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Alam niyo po, we had recently signed with the late Docs Kua a memorandum for the League of Governors to give all the provinces 50 square meters to exhibit their indigenous products.

asr-000914
02:02:57.200 --> 02:03:02.200
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: And we are signing with the cultural center dahil kulang daw sila ng exhibition spaces.

asr-000915
02:03:03.080 --> 02:03:12.200
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: And with the PIEC, PICC, another MOA po para po makapag-exhibit ang cultural center.

asr-000916
02:03:14.160 --> 02:03:17.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mr. Chairman, let me cut you there.

asr-000917
02:03:18.040 --> 02:03:25.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Dito lang po ba nakasentro sa inyong presentation sa PIEC na project, ang inyong presentation this afternoon.

asr-000918
02:03:25.300 --> 02:03:26.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Otherwise, if we will just be...

asr-000919
02:03:27.200 --> 02:03:31.740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: We will be centered on spend most of our time explaining PIEC.

asr-000920
02:03:32.040 --> 02:03:34.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ako pa tatanungin nyo, buhay benta po ito.

asr-000921
02:03:34.740 --> 02:03:36.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I mean, mabenta po sa akin.

asr-000922
02:03:36.480 --> 02:03:38.440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung tatanungin nyo, okay po ito.

asr-000923
02:03:38.800 --> 02:03:43.340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: But I have a few questions and of course, our minority leader would also ask questions.

asr-000924
02:03:43.360 --> 02:03:44.500
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: We will be happy to answer.

asr-000925
02:03:45.080 --> 02:03:48.160
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mabilisan lang ito. I hope pa, hindi na po tayo tatagal sa PIEC.

asr-000926
02:03:48.640 --> 02:03:49.340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Maganda po yan.

asr-000927
02:03:49.460 --> 02:03:52.740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung kanina po nag-usap tayo, pinipresent yun sa atin.

asr-000928
02:03:53.200 --> 02:03:54.920
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: It's a pride of our country, sir.

asr-000929
02:03:55.400 --> 02:03:56.280
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Tanong ko lang po.

asr-000930
02:03:57.200 --> 02:04:03.340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Is it expected po ba na self-sustaining itong PIEC o kailangan pa rin natin na annual government subsidy?

asr-000931
02:04:03.360 --> 02:04:05.440
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Wala na po. Wala na pong government subsidy.

asr-000932
02:04:05.440 --> 02:04:14.120
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: In fact, ang sagot lang po ng national government dito ay yung building lang po.

asr-000933
02:04:14.800 --> 02:04:25.100
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Yung pang-furnitures, fixtures, yung mga equipment, yung mga ano, will be shouldered by PRA, yung parking lot po.

asr-000934
02:04:25.760 --> 02:04:26.800
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Not the personnel.

asr-000935
02:04:26.800 --> 02:04:35.720
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Of course, kailangan po natin mga electricity dyan, water, personnel, pasweldo.

asr-000936
02:04:36.100 --> 02:04:38.720
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ilan tao po ang kakailanganin nyo dyan?

asr-000937
02:04:39.240 --> 02:04:40.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Dapat po lahat ito, naka-breakdown.

asr-000938
02:04:41.000 --> 02:04:45.160
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: On a small scale, all the exhibition centers naman make money.

asr-000939
02:04:45.760 --> 02:04:52.160
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Kasi talagang in demand po, katulad po nung eskwelahan po ng misis ko po, in Lyceum,

asr-000940
02:04:52.160 --> 02:04:56.560
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: they only have 3,000 graduates.

asr-000941
02:04:56.800 --> 02:05:01.240
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Hindi sila makapag-graduate po ng sabay-sabay.

asr-000942
02:05:01.520 --> 02:05:03.780
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: At iniimbita nila isa lang po.

asr-000943
02:05:04.260 --> 02:05:06.640
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Kasi wala po tayong exhibition center.

asr-000944
02:05:07.020 --> 02:05:13.460
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: At malaki po ang binabayad ng bawat isa po na makapaupa po.

asr-000945
02:05:13.700 --> 02:05:20.280
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: And you multiply this all over, baka sa Pilipinas lang po, fully jump-pack na po ito.

asr-000946
02:05:20.420 --> 02:05:23.700
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Kasi ang dami talagang, kulang talaga tayo ng events places.

asr-000947
02:05:23.700 --> 02:05:26.380
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: As you will know, CSM po.

asr-000948
02:05:26.800 --> 02:05:34.440
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Yung opisina po nila, kinalahati nila, giniba nila para makapagtayo ng another exhibition center.

asr-000949
02:05:34.560 --> 02:05:38.680
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Yan, makikita nyo po. Manggaling dito, papunta sa Moa.

asr-000950
02:05:40.180 --> 02:05:45.080
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Giniba po nila yung offices nila para makapagtayo po ng exhibition center.

asr-000951
02:05:45.240 --> 02:05:47.100
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Ganun po kalaki ang demand na exhibition.

asr-000952
02:05:47.780 --> 02:05:50.620
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: At ang pangulo po natin ay hindi magpapahuli.

asr-000953
02:05:50.620 --> 02:05:55.620
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: At nauna po, with this vision, we commend him for...

asr-000954
02:05:56.800 --> 02:06:00.800
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: for coming up with this project and we are supporting it po.

asr-000955
02:06:01.020 --> 02:06:05.500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Alright, Mr. Chairman. With the indulgence of our minority leader, okay na po sa inyo.

asr-000956
02:06:05.580 --> 02:06:11.080
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Para sa akin eh. Okay na po itong presentation ng PIEC or you have questions pa about PIEC?

asr-000957
02:06:11.100 --> 02:06:12.140
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: 20 pages na lang po.

asr-000958
02:06:13.220 --> 02:06:14.120
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Joke. Joke pa, boss.

asr-000959
02:06:16.000 --> 02:06:17.720
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Go ahead po. Go ahead po, minority leader.

asr-000960
02:06:18.120 --> 02:06:19.340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000961
02:06:19.340 --> 02:06:23.260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Actually, yung questions ko ay para kay GM at assistant GM.

asr-000962
02:06:23.840 --> 02:06:24.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But on this lang, sir.

asr-000963
02:06:25.680 --> 02:06:26.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Um...

asr-000964
02:06:26.480 --> 02:06:33.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: First, eto, public service din. Parang radio program ni Senator Tulfo. May nagpapatanong.

asr-000965
02:06:33.980 --> 02:06:41.900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yung Las Piñas wetland park land title, kailan daw po itatransfer ng PRA to DENR?

asr-000966
02:06:43.360 --> 02:06:44.740
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: See, there was a bill.

asr-000967
02:06:45.660 --> 02:06:48.180
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: There was a bill to have it transferred.

asr-000968
02:06:48.180 --> 02:06:52.660
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: And I think it was passed by Congress and the Senate.

asr-000969
02:06:53.340 --> 02:06:55.800
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: But the President po vetoed the bill.

asr-000970
02:06:56.480 --> 02:06:58.200
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: At hindi na po itatransfer.

asr-000971
02:06:58.800 --> 02:07:01.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, it will be kept by PRA?

asr-000972
02:07:01.980 --> 02:07:02.320
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Opo.

asr-000973
02:07:02.580 --> 02:07:05.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sige. So, malamang yung follow-up question neto sa plenary na, Mr. Chair.

asr-000974
02:07:06.280 --> 02:07:07.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At least natanong ko lang.

asr-000975
02:07:07.660 --> 02:07:08.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Second, Chair.

asr-000976
02:07:09.860 --> 02:07:11.660
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sir Chairman, so tama po ba ako?

asr-000977
02:07:11.880 --> 02:07:18.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, yung iniingin yung total na 27 billion will be doon sa development netong PIEC?

asr-000978
02:07:18.480 --> 02:07:19.660
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: The building lang po.

asr-000979
02:07:19.980 --> 02:07:25.240
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: At this budget, dumaan lang sa amin as a subsidy.

asr-000980
02:07:25.240 --> 02:07:26.540
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Kasi kami ang may-ari.

asr-000981
02:07:27.260 --> 02:07:29.440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, kayo may-ari nung lupa?

asr-000982
02:07:29.720 --> 02:07:31.660
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Hindi lang ng lupa. Pati ho nung project.

asr-000983
02:07:31.940 --> 02:07:36.000
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Hindi nung mga kami ang magpupuno dahil may konti nga kaming cash.

asr-000984
02:07:36.060 --> 02:07:37.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, that's what I wanted to clarify.

asr-000985
02:07:37.540 --> 02:07:41.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yung lupa na na-reclaim is yung share nyo sa ibang projects.

asr-000986
02:07:41.800 --> 02:07:47.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, rather than flipping it or selling it or bidding it out,

asr-000987
02:07:48.380 --> 02:07:53.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: you want to see if, yun nga, given such a ambitious good project,

asr-000988
02:07:54.360 --> 02:07:55.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: you can...

asr-000989
02:07:55.240 --> 02:07:56.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: you can do it this way.

asr-000990
02:07:57.160 --> 02:07:59.240
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: With your indulgence, not only that,

asr-000991
02:08:00.760 --> 02:08:03.540
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: biglahong tumaas ang presyo po ng lupa namin.

asr-000992
02:08:03.700 --> 02:08:06.340
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Kasi this is only 80,000 square.

asr-000993
02:08:06.460 --> 02:08:07.620
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: We still have 3 million.

asr-000994
02:08:08.260 --> 02:08:09.460
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Nung nilagay namin ito...

asr-000995
02:08:09.460 --> 02:08:10.400
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: And even the other developments.

asr-000996
02:08:11.040 --> 02:08:13.320
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Kasi kahit sabihin mong competitor sila,

asr-000997
02:08:13.440 --> 02:08:15.260
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: pag ganyang kaganda yung katabi,

asr-000998
02:08:15.820 --> 02:08:16.400
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: tumataas.

asr-000999
02:08:16.520 --> 02:08:20.320
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Diba? Like when ginawa yung Santa Rosa or ginawa BGC,

asr-001000
02:08:20.500 --> 02:08:21.420
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: ginawa Rockwell,

asr-001001
02:08:22.020 --> 02:08:24.440
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: automatically tumataas din yung mga katabi.

asr-001002
02:08:24.440 --> 02:08:25.060
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: 64.

asr-001003
02:08:25.060 --> 02:08:28.400
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: 24,000 nga po, two years ago, ang appraisal sa amin.

asr-001004
02:08:29.000 --> 02:08:31.540
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Ngayon po, ang appraisal, 300,000 na po.

asr-001005
02:08:31.640 --> 02:08:32.520
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Marami na pong bumili.

asr-001006
02:08:32.920 --> 02:08:37.080
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: 24 hectares na po ang nabili after we have a...

asr-001007
02:08:37.080 --> 02:08:38.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, last two questions.

asr-001008
02:08:38.680 --> 02:08:39.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: May...

asr-001009
02:08:39.360 --> 02:08:41.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Just to support your question kanina,

asr-001010
02:08:43.080 --> 02:08:45.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Senator Caetano.

asr-001011
02:08:45.680 --> 02:08:47.900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung sinasabing nyo po na 27 billion,

asr-001012
02:08:48.180 --> 02:08:50.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: for your information, minority leader,

asr-001013
02:08:50.860 --> 02:08:53.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: actually, 6 billion po ang inilabas

asr-001014
02:08:53.300 --> 02:08:54.780
Senator Erwin Tulfo: sa unprogrammed appropriations po ng 2024 GAA,

asr-001015
02:08:54.780 --> 02:08:57.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: some appropriations po ng 2024, ga-a.

asr-001016
02:08:57.920 --> 02:09:00.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Tapos, nagdagdaga ng 6 billion naman,

asr-001017
02:09:00.520 --> 02:09:03.340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: contingency fund ng 2026, ga-a.

asr-001018
02:09:03.820 --> 02:09:04.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, total na po,

asr-001019
02:09:04.920 --> 02:09:07.740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: tapos sumingi po kayo nga ng 5 billion for 2027.

asr-001020
02:09:08.180 --> 02:09:10.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, that will be 17 billion.

asr-001021
02:09:10.360 --> 02:09:12.020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ang estimate po, 27.

asr-001022
02:09:12.280 --> 02:09:14.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, kulang pa po ng 10 billion.

asr-001023
02:09:14.320 --> 02:09:15.180
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Is that what you're saying?

asr-001024
02:09:15.540 --> 02:09:17.760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nasaan na po tayo ngayon sa construction?

asr-001025
02:09:18.060 --> 02:09:18.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ilang percent?

asr-001026
02:09:18.820 --> 02:09:20.540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Madagdag-dagdagan ko lang po yung katabi.

asr-001027
02:09:20.540 --> 02:09:20.780
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: We are...

asr-001028
02:09:21.360 --> 02:09:22.100
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Alam nyo naman po,

asr-001029
02:09:22.200 --> 02:09:23.800
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: construction is an S-curve.

asr-001030
02:09:23.900 --> 02:09:24.540
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Mabagal po.

asr-001031
02:09:24.780 --> 02:09:25.700
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Ang akyat niyan,

asr-001032
02:09:26.340 --> 02:09:28.480
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: nasa 11% po tayo.

asr-001033
02:09:28.960 --> 02:09:30.320
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: But the DPWH,

asr-001034
02:09:30.800 --> 02:09:33.100
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: we have a program of expenditures

asr-001035
02:09:33.100 --> 02:09:35.280
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: signed by the DPWH.

asr-001036
02:09:35.820 --> 02:09:37.260
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Hiningan po namin sila.

asr-001037
02:09:38.240 --> 02:09:41.120
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Sila po ang nagsabi nitong pangangailangan na to.

asr-001038
02:09:41.800 --> 02:09:43.960
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Sila ang nagprogram sa amin

asr-001039
02:09:43.960 --> 02:09:46.120
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: kasi kami, daanan lang ng pera.

asr-001040
02:09:47.280 --> 02:09:48.740
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Hindi ko malaman, sila nag-bid.

asr-001041
02:09:48.760 --> 02:09:50.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I think what the chairman means is,

asr-001042
02:09:50.560 --> 02:09:52.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: so how much do you need for 2027?

asr-001043
02:09:53.360 --> 02:09:54.120
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Five lang po.

asr-001044
02:09:54.120 --> 02:09:54.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Five.

asr-001045
02:09:54.780 --> 02:09:56.680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And then 2028, five ulit.

asr-001046
02:09:57.540 --> 02:09:58.360
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Ten po.

asr-001047
02:09:58.580 --> 02:10:04.340
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Pero according to DBM and to Secretary of Public Works,

asr-001048
02:10:05.000 --> 02:10:06.420
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: and upon my request,

asr-001049
02:10:06.880 --> 02:10:08.560
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: ililipat na ho namin sa kanila

asr-001050
02:10:08.560 --> 02:10:09.960
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: kasi tumatagal yung ikot.

asr-001051
02:10:10.060 --> 02:10:11.320
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Although three days lang sa amin,

asr-001052
02:10:11.440 --> 02:10:13.000
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: ayaw namin hawakan ho yung pera.

asr-001053
02:10:13.460 --> 02:10:17.460
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Kasi gusto namin talaga maging successful ang uto

asr-001054
02:10:17.460 --> 02:10:19.240
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: kasi napakaganda po sa bayan ito.

asr-001055
02:10:19.260 --> 02:10:20.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: What's the completion date nito, Mr. Chairman?

asr-001056
02:10:21.460 --> 02:10:23.660
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: When are we looking at?

asr-001057
02:10:23.660 --> 02:10:24.220
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: April.

asr-001058
02:10:24.780 --> 02:10:25.980
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: April 2028.

asr-001059
02:10:26.360 --> 02:10:29.120
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: So we have already several events lined up

asr-001060
02:10:29.120 --> 02:10:32.400
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: for April and May 2028.

asr-001061
02:10:32.700 --> 02:10:33.760
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, on that point,

asr-001062
02:10:34.440 --> 02:10:36.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: hindi madali maghanap ng pera.

asr-001063
02:10:36.480 --> 02:10:37.400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But on that point,

asr-001064
02:10:38.000 --> 02:10:40.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: kung hinahabol ng April 2028,

asr-001065
02:10:40.600 --> 02:10:43.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: hindi ba too late kung yung 10B 2028 pa ibibigay?

asr-001066
02:10:44.520 --> 02:10:47.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi given certain delays and everything,

asr-001067
02:10:47.700 --> 02:10:49.100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: katulad ngayon, it's September.

asr-001068
02:10:49.540 --> 02:10:51.900
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Malaki po dito retention po, sir.

asr-001069
02:10:52.780 --> 02:10:54.120
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: They will have retention

asr-001070
