PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: With the project, the lakeshore project which did not push through, yes, Sir, Your Honor.

asr-001247
02:21:35.000 --> 02:21:40.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Diba pa yun? 2015 yun. Yun yung C6 na 8 lanes, diba?

asr-001248
02:21:40.000 --> 02:21:41.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001249
02:21:41.000 --> 02:21:43.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kumuha ba ng permit sa PRA yun?

asr-001250
02:21:45.000 --> 02:21:47.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Binid yun, diba? Hindi lang natuloy.

asr-001251
02:21:47.000 --> 02:21:48.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Po.

asr-001252
02:21:48.000 --> 02:21:50.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kumuha ba ng permit sa PRA?

asr-001253
02:21:50.000 --> 02:21:51.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Hindi, Po.

asr-001254
02:21:51.000 --> 02:21:55.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: How about yung Manggahan-Cladway? Kumuha ba ng permit sa PRA yun?

asr-001255
02:21:55.000 --> 02:21:56.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Hindi rin, Po.

asr-001256
02:21:56.000 --> 02:21:58.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero do you classify that as a reclamation?

asr-001257
02:21:58.000 --> 02:22:01.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir. Yes, Sir.

asr-001258
02:22:01.000 --> 02:22:02.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero hindi kumuha ng permit sa inyo?

asr-001259
02:22:02.000 --> 02:22:03.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Po.

asr-001260
02:22:03.000 --> 02:22:07.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. So, sa yung panahon ni Pinoy na hindi rin kumuha?

asr-001261
02:22:07.000 --> 02:22:08.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Hindi, Po.

asr-001262
02:22:08.000 --> 02:22:16.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. Sa House of Representatives, tinanong sa inyo whether or not in other parts of the Laguna Lake, Rizal, Laguna,

asr-001263
02:22:16.000 --> 02:22:19.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: kung kumuha ng permit sa inyo sa reclamation, meron ba?

asr-001264
02:22:19.000 --> 02:22:20.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Wala, Po.

asr-001265
02:22:20.000 --> 02:22:22.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Wala? As of now, wala?

asr-001266
02:22:22.000 --> 02:22:23.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Wala, Po.

asr-001267
02:22:23.000 --> 02:22:35.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. So, pero pag meron reclamation doon, na nakita niyo ngayon, kahit siya ay sa gobyerno, you will ask the DPWH to stop it?

asr-001268
02:22:35.000 --> 02:22:43.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: No, that's part of our complete stop work, Your Honor. Hingi po kami ng records and then we'll have them comply.

asr-001269
02:22:43.000 --> 02:22:45.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Oh, did you ask the DPWH for the records for the Tagalog?

asr-001270
02:22:45.000 --> 02:22:48.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001271
02:22:48.000 --> 02:22:52.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And then, kailan niyo sinabing cease and desist?

asr-001272
02:22:52.000 --> 02:23:03.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Even before that, Sir, meron na po kaming show cause on the Laguna Lakeshore Road Network.

asr-001273
02:23:03.000 --> 02:23:05.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kanino niyo in-issue, Sir, ang show cause?

asr-001274
02:23:05.000 --> 02:23:07.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sa DPWH, Po.

asr-001275
02:23:07.000 --> 02:23:09.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Do you have a copy?

asr-001276
02:23:09.000 --> 02:23:12.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: We have a letter since 2024.

asr-001277
02:23:12.000 --> 02:23:13.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: 2020?

asr-001278
02:23:13.000 --> 02:23:14.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Four.

asr-001279
02:23:14.000 --> 02:23:15.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Two?

asr-001280
02:23:15.000 --> 02:23:16.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: 2024?

asr-001281
02:23:16.000 --> 02:23:17.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001282
02:23:17.000 --> 02:23:18.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, kay Secretary Bonoan pa lang?

asr-001283
02:23:18.000 --> 02:23:19.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001284
02:23:19.000 --> 02:23:25.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. So, pinatigil niyo rin ba yung Laguna Lake Road Network?

asr-001285
02:23:25.000 --> 02:23:40.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Your Honor, we asked for the details and whether there is a reclamation and then they answered that it's just a road network and they are making sure through PRA that there would be no reclamation.

asr-001286
02:23:40.000 --> 02:23:44.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Very good. Can I see the picture of the LLRN?

asr-001287
02:23:45.000 --> 02:23:47.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Kaming po dito.

asr-001288
02:23:47.000 --> 02:24:11.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, take note, Mr. Chairman, Mr. GM. Sabi ng Deputy GM niyo, kapag katagig, kailangan may complete staff work. Kailangan kunin lahat. Pero pag ibang part ng Laguna Lake, okay lang yung sabi-sabi ng DPWH. Hindi niya hiningi yung papers eh. Sinabi niya, okay lang sa inyo na tanungin lang sila.

asr-001289
02:24:11.000 --> 02:24:14.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At ang sinabi daw, there is no reclamation.

asr-001290
02:24:14.000 --> 02:24:35.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ano tawag mo sa kulay pula at kulay blue na yun? Which is about anywhere between 100 to 100 meters from the shoreline to 1 kilometer from the shoreline. Ano tawag mo dyan? 8 lanes yan sa tubig gagawin. Hindi reclamation yan?

asr-001291
02:24:35.000 --> 02:24:38.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Actually, Your Honor…

asr-001292
02:24:38.000 --> 02:24:40.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nasa website yan ng LLDA.

asr-001293
02:24:40.000 --> 02:24:41.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001294
02:24:41.000 --> 02:24:42.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nasa website yan ng DPWH.

asr-001295
02:24:42.000 --> 02:24:43.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001296
02:24:43.000 --> 02:24:45.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, hindi reclamation yan?

asr-001297
02:24:45.000 --> 02:24:46.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Reclamation.

asr-001298
02:24:46.000 --> 02:24:48.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sa definition niyo, reclamation yan, di ba?

asr-001299
02:24:48.000 --> 02:24:49.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001300
02:24:49.000 --> 02:24:50.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, sa iyo hindi reclamation yan?

asr-001301
02:24:50.000 --> 02:24:51.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Reclamation, Sir.

asr-001302
02:24:51.000 --> 02:24:53.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Bakit hindi niyo in-issue ng cease of business?

asr-001303
02:24:53.000 --> 02:24:54.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, there is…

asr-001304
02:24:54.000 --> 02:24:55.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi hindi tagig yan?

asr-001305
02:24:55.000 --> 02:24:56.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Ano, Sir?

asr-001306
02:24:56.000 --> 02:25:03.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sabi mo kanina eh, kapag meron kayong nakita, ipapa-full staff work niyo. Sabi niyo, ang tagig, pinul staff work niyo.

asr-001307
02:25:03.000 --> 02:25:04.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001308
02:25:04.000 --> 02:25:12.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nung tinanong ko sa iyo, paano naman yung Laguna Lake Road Network, tinanong mo lang sa DPWH. At sinagot na walang reclamation. Ano tawag mo?

asr-001309
02:25:12.000 --> 02:25:13.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, there is…

asr-001310
02:25:13.000 --> 02:25:19.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ano tawag mo diyan, Sir? Sagutin mo nalang tanong ko, please. Ano tawag mo diyan? Hindi ba reclamation yan?

asr-001311
02:25:19.000 --> 02:25:20.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001312
02:25:20.000 --> 02:25:22.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O, under your definition, reclamation yan?

asr-001313
02:25:22.000 --> 02:25:23.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001314
02:25:23.000 --> 02:25:24.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O, ba't hindi niyo isis and desis?

asr-001315
02:25:24.000 --> 02:25:29.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Actually, Sir, they have committed to realign, redesign the project…

asr-001316
02:25:29.000 --> 02:25:31.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: They're not. They're building it already.

asr-001317
02:25:31.000 --> 02:25:32.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001318
02:25:32.000 --> 02:25:33.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O, they're building it already.

asr-001319
02:25:33.000 --> 02:25:34.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, yes, Sir.

asr-001320
02:25:34.000 --> 02:25:38.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: How many times bigger yan, yung pinag-uusapan natin sa tagig?

asr-001321
02:25:38.000 --> 02:25:41.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, they would be complying with our requirements.

asr-001322
02:25:41.000 --> 02:25:42.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001323
02:25:42.000 --> 02:25:48.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: How will they comply with your requirements? While they're doing it now, they're building.

asr-001324
02:25:48.000 --> 02:25:49.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001325
02:25:49.000 --> 02:25:53.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi ba requirement niyo bago mag-reclaim, kailangan kompleto pati sa checklist?

asr-001326
02:25:53.000 --> 02:25:56.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: That's for regular reclamation, Your Honor.

asr-001327
02:25:56.000 --> 02:25:58.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O, ano ba itong tawag sakali?

asr-001328
02:25:58.000 --> 02:26:09.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: But there are instances wherein this had been approved by the government, but because they did not go through the PRA process, they would have a post facto compliance.

asr-001329
02:26:09.000 --> 02:26:11.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, no, no, Sir. Huwag mo akong bulahin.

asr-001330
02:26:11.000 --> 02:26:15.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Huwag mo akong bulahin. Yung post niyo, binasa ko yung rules niyo.

asr-001331
02:26:15.000 --> 02:26:16.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001332
02:26:16.000 --> 02:26:28.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang sinasabi dito, kapag ka ang national government or local government ay nag-reclaim at unauthorized, pwede silang mag-apply na mapunta sa kanila. Hindi ibig sabihin na pag wala silang permit, pwede lang ituloy-tuloy.

asr-001333
02:26:28.000 --> 02:26:38.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, you have to decide now. Do you have jurisdiction over LLDA or not? If you have, then you have to stop all of the illegal reclamation.

asr-001334
02:26:38.000 --> 02:26:40.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ongoing ngayon yung DPWH project.

asr-001335
02:26:40.000 --> 02:26:54.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Na damuhala ang laki compared sa tagig. Na hindi nag-submit sa inyo ng feasibility study. Na hindi nag-submit sa inyo ng environmental study. So, you will ignore that? Bakit?

asr-001336
02:26:54.000 --> 02:26:55.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: No, Sir.

asr-001337
02:26:55.000 --> 02:26:58.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, you're ignoring it now. You're not asking them to stop it.

asr-001338
02:26:58.000 --> 02:27:00.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, we are now coordinating.

asr-001339
02:27:00.000 --> 02:27:05.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, no, no, no. You're not coordinating. You do not have a letter to cease and desist. You do not have a letter to show cause.

asr-001340
02:27:05.000 --> 02:27:08.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, we have a letter with the DPWH.

asr-001341
02:27:08.000 --> 02:27:09.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Telling them to stop it.

asr-001342
02:27:09.000 --> 02:27:10.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Telling them to stop it.

asr-001343
02:27:10.000 --> 02:27:20.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: And then they also filed, Sir, the information about the LLRN, Your Honor. It's part of our CSW at present.

asr-001344
02:27:20.000 --> 02:27:30.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. Sundan ko, Honorable Board, sundan ko logic ng inyong deputy. So, kung yan ang gawin ng tagig, wala na tayong problema?

asr-001345
02:27:30.000 --> 02:27:32.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, yes, Sir.

asr-001346
02:27:32.000 --> 02:27:35.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, pag sinubmit nila yung information, tapos pinakita nila ng gobyerno.

asr-001347
02:27:35.000 --> 02:27:37.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, we'll go through the process, Your Honor.

asr-001348
02:27:37.000 --> 02:27:42.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Of the regularization of the unauthorized projects.

asr-001349
02:27:42.000 --> 02:27:50.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. So, I'll ask you. Hindi sinasubmit sa inyo ng DPWH kasi sa Friday nandito sila. Sino proponent ng LLRN?

asr-001350
02:27:50.000 --> 02:27:53.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, it's Laguna Lake Development Authority and DPWH.

asr-001351
02:27:53.000 --> 02:27:55.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, no, no. No, it's DPWH.

asr-001352
02:27:55.000 --> 02:27:56.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001353
02:27:56.000 --> 02:28:00.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. O, sino ang proponent ng mga sinisist and desist nyo sa tagig?

asr-001354
02:28:00.000 --> 02:28:01.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: DPWH also, Your Honor.

asr-001355
02:28:01.000 --> 02:28:02.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O, sila din eh.

asr-001356
02:28:02.000 --> 02:28:03.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Kaya po.

asr-001357
02:28:03.000 --> 02:28:05.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O, so you're, no. I want to get information from you now.

asr-001358
02:28:05.000 --> 02:28:06.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So that I can confirm.

asr-001359
02:28:06.000 --> 02:28:08.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So that I can confront them on Friday.

asr-001360
02:28:08.000 --> 02:28:12.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, you're telling me now sa LLRN.

asr-001361
02:28:12.000 --> 02:28:13.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sila po.

asr-001362
02:28:13.000 --> 02:28:16.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nagko-coordinate sila. Pero sa tagig projects hindi sila nagko-coordinate.

asr-001363
02:28:16.000 --> 02:28:17.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, nagko-coordinate din po sila.

asr-001364
02:28:17.000 --> 02:28:20.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O, eh bakit mo sinisist and desist yung isa? Nagko-coordinate na pala eh.

asr-001365
02:28:20.000 --> 02:28:24.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, that's part of the cease and desist order.

asr-001366
02:28:24.000 --> 02:28:25.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, I'm trying to see, Sir.

asr-001367
02:28:25.000 --> 02:28:26.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001368
02:28:26.000 --> 02:28:35.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: If you're doing selective justice here. You have two projects. One is more than ten times bigger. One is ten times smaller. Same proponent.

asr-001369
02:28:36.000 --> 02:28:41.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: One is even more useful than the other. May gumagamit na ba nung highway ngayon?

asr-001370
02:28:41.000 --> 02:28:42.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Nung LLRN, Sir?

asr-001371
02:28:42.000 --> 02:28:43.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Oo.

asr-001372
02:28:43.000 --> 02:28:44.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Wala pa po.

asr-001373
02:28:44.000 --> 02:28:45.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Oo. So, wala pang public use yun?

asr-001374
02:28:45.000 --> 02:28:46.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

asr-001375
02:28:46.000 --> 02:28:51.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sir, with your permission, Mr. Chairman. This is a one-minute video. Can you show the one-minute video?

asr-001376
02:29:02.000 --> 02:29:03.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yes?

asr-001377
02:29:06.000 --> 02:29:09.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes, Sir.

asr-001378
02:29:13.000 --> 02:29:23.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O, Mr. Literal. That is the linear park na ginagawa ngayon. That is public use. Hindi private yan.

asr-001379
02:29:25.000 --> 02:29:35.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pag Christmas, 30,000 people a night dun sa 2 hectare na yan. Pwera pa dun. Okay. Hindi ba yan ay public use?

asr-001380
02:29:36.000 --> 02:29:37.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi.

asr-001381
02:29:37.000 --> 02:29:41.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. Yung tinap niyo, shophouses.

asr-001382
02:29:41.000 --> 02:29:42.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ano pa?

asr-001383
02:29:42.000 --> 02:30:00.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Shophouses. Singapore. Lahat ng Pilipino sinasabi, sanang may ganito tayo sa Pilipinas. Ginagawa ngayon. Yung katabi, I'm not at liberty to tell you who designed it. He's one of the best designers in the country na environmentalist na ginagamit ng national government.

asr-001384
02:30:00.000 --> 02:30:07.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang katabi na susunod na gagawin ay yung parang fund to make sure na walang erosion para sa environment.

asr-001385
02:30:07.820 --> 02:30:09.840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Did you know that yun ang isang STINAP niya?

asr-001386
02:30:12.140 --> 02:30:13.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Did you know that?

asr-001387
02:30:13.400 --> 02:30:13.740
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: No, sir.

asr-001388
02:30:15.080 --> 02:30:19.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Have you ever written the city of Taguig to ask about the project?

asr-001389
02:30:20.000 --> 02:30:23.980
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, we have written the city of Taguig last October 2025.

asr-001390
02:30:23.980 --> 02:30:30.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, no, that's not my question. My question is, have you ever written the city of Taguig to ask them about the projects?

asr-001391
02:30:31.580 --> 02:30:32.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: About the lots.

asr-001392
02:30:32.900 --> 02:30:43.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. Ang sinasabi mo, nagsalita ka sa bilyonaryo, ang sabi niyo po, sir, may show cost order kayo sa city.

asr-001393
02:30:44.160 --> 02:30:44.540
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001394
02:30:45.000 --> 02:30:48.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Can you show me sa letter, saan nakalagay dito show cost?

asr-001395
02:30:49.080 --> 02:30:53.960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Binasa ko yung letter pa ulit-ulit. Ang nakalagay dito, ma'am, pakibigay yung mga tito.

asr-001396
02:30:53.980 --> 02:31:01.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang nakalagay dito, ma'am, ano yung project? Wala pong nakalagay dito show cost. Wala po.

asr-001397
02:31:02.160 --> 02:31:07.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang nakalagay dito, itong mga lupa na ito may titolo, pakita titolo sa PRA.

asr-001398
02:31:07.860 --> 02:31:13.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang nakapirma po dito, sir, kayo po. Kaya kayo po tinatanong kasi taga-DNR po kayo.

asr-001399
02:31:13.800 --> 02:31:15.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, balikan ko yun, sir, ha?

asr-001400
02:31:15.260 --> 02:31:15.560
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001401
02:31:15.660 --> 02:31:20.160
