Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, balik tayo sa Laguna Lake.

asr-001569
02:39:32.760 --> 02:39:34.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sino ang may jurisdiction sa Laguna Lake?

asr-001570
02:39:35.520 --> 02:39:39.380
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, actually, sir, we have overlapping jurisdiction with LLDA.

asr-001571
02:39:39.500 --> 02:39:39.860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sige po.

asr-001572
02:39:40.160 --> 02:39:41.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kayo, sir, lawyer, di ba?

asr-001573
02:39:41.640 --> 02:39:42.040
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes po.

asr-001574
02:39:42.100 --> 02:39:42.260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-001575
02:39:42.820 --> 02:39:47.340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: When you have overlapping jurisdiction, you look at its source.

asr-001576
02:39:47.500 --> 02:39:47.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Tama, sir?

asr-001577
02:39:47.880 --> 02:39:48.380
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001578
02:39:48.980 --> 02:39:51.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, your source is your law and the law ng LLDA?

asr-001579
02:39:52.040 --> 02:39:52.400
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001580
02:39:52.820 --> 02:39:53.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-001581
02:39:53.540 --> 02:40:02.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And has LLDA in the past ever signified that they have exclusive jurisdiction over the Laguna Lake?

asr-001582
02:40:04.100 --> 02:40:04.840
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, they have, sir.

asr-001583
02:40:04.900 --> 02:40:05.400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: They have, di ba?

asr-001584
02:40:05.720 --> 02:40:07.400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And has PRA respected that?

asr-001585
02:40:09.280 --> 02:40:11.820
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Actually, we secured opinions from…

asr-001586
02:40:11.820 --> 02:40:11.840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, no.

asr-001587
02:40:11.840 --> 02:40:14.040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sagutin mo muna tanong ko, then we'll go to that.

asr-001588
02:40:14.280 --> 02:40:14.640
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: No, sir.

asr-001589
02:40:14.640 --> 02:40:18.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, it is only in 2025 that you first…

asr-001590
02:40:18.980 --> 02:40:24.840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: When you first started to write everyone to try to assert jurisdiction, tama po ba?

asr-001591
02:40:25.100 --> 02:40:25.540
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Hindi po.

asr-001592
02:40:25.980 --> 02:40:26.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kailan po?

asr-001593
02:40:26.880 --> 02:40:29.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Before 2025, kailan kayo sumulat?

asr-001594
02:40:29.180 --> 02:40:32.480
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Actually, sir, ano yung OGCC?

asr-001595
02:40:35.480 --> 02:40:43.480
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, as early as 1995, we already, because of the overlapping jurisdiction, we already secured an OGCC opinion.

asr-001596
02:40:43.820 --> 02:40:45.600
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Because we're both clients of the OGCC.

asr-001597
02:40:45.600 --> 02:40:45.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-001598
02:40:46.100 --> 02:40:47.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: What about the DOJ?

asr-001599
02:40:47.720 --> 02:40:51.920
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. Between an OGCC and DOJ opinion, what will prevail?

asr-001600
02:40:55.220 --> 02:40:56.100
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, DOJ.

asr-001601
02:40:56.540 --> 02:40:59.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. So, what does the DO… May DOJ opinion na ba?

asr-001602
02:40:59.700 --> 02:41:00.440
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001603
02:41:00.800 --> 02:41:02.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ano sabi ng DOJ?

asr-001604
02:41:02.440 --> 02:41:10.460
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, kailangan, sir, i-harmonize. There are no conflicting provision. Kailangan lang, sir, harmonization ng tulos.

asr-001605
02:41:10.520 --> 02:41:14.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Which one yun? Anong resolution ang sinasabi mo sa DOJ?

asr-001606
02:41:15.000 --> 02:41:15.720
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir?

asr-001607
02:41:15.720 --> 02:41:24.020
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, sir, sa DOJ opinion pala, such being the case, the two provisions being in pari materia, yun nga.

asr-001608
02:41:24.140 --> 02:41:39.260
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, sa DOJ opinion, first, opinion number 106, series of 1995, no substantial conflict exists between the provisions of Section 4I of the LLDA Act and Section 4A of the PEA Charter.

asr-001609
02:41:39.560 --> 02:41:45.700
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Such being the case, the two provisions being in pari materia, the rule that the special law shall remain as an exception.

asr-001612
02:41:45.880 --> 02:41:50.540
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: To the general law applies exproprio vigore.

asr-001613
02:41:51.760 --> 02:41:55.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Explain to your colleagues kasi yung iba sa kanila yung mga engineer.

asr-001614
02:41:56.620 --> 02:42:05.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, that means, tama ba ako? That since special law ang LLDA, LLDA ang may jurisdiction sa Laguna Lake pagdating ng reclamation, hindi kayo?

asr-001615
02:42:06.720 --> 02:42:07.540
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: No, sir.

asr-001616
02:42:07.900 --> 02:42:09.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yun ang ibig sabi niya, ayan o.

asr-001617
02:42:09.720 --> 02:42:14.440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: In the instant case, no substantial conflict exists between provisions of 4-1.

asr-001618
02:42:15.080 --> 02:42:15.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Such being the case, the two provisions being in pari materia, the rule that the special law shall remain as an exception.

asr-001619
02:42:15.700 --> 02:42:24.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, that being the case, the two provisions are in pari materia, the rule above stated, the special law shall remain as an exception to the general law.

asr-001620
02:42:25.340 --> 02:42:27.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: The general law is the PRA law.

asr-001621
02:42:27.680 --> 02:42:30.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: The special law is the LLDA law.

asr-001622
02:42:30.700 --> 02:42:32.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: The LLDA law says they can reclaim.

asr-001623
02:42:33.340 --> 02:42:42.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: They passed a resolution of their own in 1995 saying that they have exclusive jurisdiction in reclamation in LLDA.

asr-001624
02:42:44.000 --> 02:42:45.680
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Your Honor, can I explain?

asr-001625
02:42:45.700 --> 02:42:46.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Go ahead, yes.

asr-001626
02:42:46.560 --> 02:42:54.360
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Actually, the exclusive jurisdiction over sa general and special is over Laguna Lake.

asr-001627
02:42:54.840 --> 02:42:55.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes.

asr-001628
02:42:55.340 --> 02:42:55.700
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001629
02:42:56.080 --> 02:42:57.900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And reclamation in Laguna Lake.

asr-001630
02:42:57.920 --> 02:43:00.860
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: But on the reclamation, sir, nagbaliktad, sir.

asr-001631
02:43:01.420 --> 02:43:02.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nasaan nakalagay yun?

asr-001632
02:43:03.820 --> 02:43:06.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nasaan nakalagay dito sa October 12, 1995?

asr-001633
02:43:06.940 --> 02:43:07.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay, fine.

asr-001634
02:43:13.020 --> 02:43:15.680
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, doon sa DOJ opinion.

asr-001635
02:43:15.700 --> 02:43:21.860
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Nang 12 October, sir, yun yung sinabi na wala na special.

asr-001636
02:43:22.040 --> 02:43:22.600
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001637
02:43:22.880 --> 02:43:23.200
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001638
02:43:23.280 --> 02:43:24.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: It's a special law.

asr-001639
02:43:24.260 --> 02:43:26.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And the special law sabi, they have the power to reclaim.

asr-001640
02:43:27.260 --> 02:43:27.620
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001641
02:43:27.640 --> 02:43:28.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And they passed a board resolution.

asr-001642
02:43:29.360 --> 02:43:29.700
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001643
02:43:29.740 --> 02:43:32.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Said that they have exclusive right to reclaim.

asr-001644
02:43:32.580 --> 02:43:32.880
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001645
02:43:33.120 --> 02:43:33.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Oh.

asr-001646
02:43:33.720 --> 02:43:35.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And you never questioned that.

asr-001647
02:43:36.160 --> 02:43:39.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Reclaim ng reclaim ang gobyerno through the LLDA.

asr-001648
02:43:40.340 --> 02:43:40.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Oh.

asr-001649
02:43:42.360 --> 02:43:43.260
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, can I read the...

asr-001650
02:43:43.260 --> 02:43:43.960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes, go ahead, please.

asr-001651
02:43:44.520 --> 02:43:45.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pareho naman tayong hapang.

asr-001652
02:43:45.300 --> 02:43:45.560
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001653
02:43:45.560 --> 02:43:45.680
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001654
02:43:45.700 --> 02:43:45.880
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001655
02:43:46.300 --> 02:43:49.600
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, doon sa last paragraph, sir, nung DOJ opinion.

asr-001656
02:43:49.600 --> 02:43:50.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes, yun ang binasa ko.

asr-001657
02:43:50.500 --> 02:43:50.760
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001658
02:43:51.320 --> 02:43:56.100
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: The rule above stated, special law shall remain as an exception.

asr-001659
02:43:57.020 --> 02:44:00.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, ibig sabihin, the general rule is, basta't reclamation, PRA.

asr-001660
02:44:00.900 --> 02:44:01.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: What is the exception?

asr-001661
02:44:02.800 --> 02:44:04.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: The special law, Laguna Lake.

asr-001662
02:44:04.620 --> 02:44:05.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001663
02:44:05.240 --> 02:44:05.400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Oh.

asr-001664
02:44:06.160 --> 02:44:09.740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Tinawagan ko rin ang PRA nung panahon ni PRRD.

asr-001665
02:44:10.200 --> 02:44:11.040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yun din ang sinabi.

asr-001666
02:44:11.820 --> 02:44:15.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Na hindi kayo nakikialam sa Laguna Lake because nga, they have a special law.

asr-001667
02:44:15.360 --> 02:44:19.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And pareho kayong kumukuha ng NEDA approval, di ba?

asr-001668
02:44:21.100 --> 02:44:21.520
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: No, sir.

asr-001669
02:44:22.220 --> 02:44:23.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ngayon, may delegated kayo.

asr-001670
02:44:23.740 --> 02:44:23.900
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001671
02:44:24.320 --> 02:44:25.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero may iba-iba kayo, di ba?

asr-001672
02:44:25.740 --> 02:44:26.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You were under...

asr-001673
02:44:27.220 --> 02:44:30.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: If you follow the history, you were under DPWH.

asr-001674
02:44:31.060 --> 02:44:31.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Before.

asr-001675
02:44:31.640 --> 02:44:33.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Tapos, binalik kayo doon.

asr-001676
02:44:33.640 --> 02:44:34.000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001677
02:44:34.060 --> 02:44:35.260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nag-DNR and OP ngayon.

asr-001678
02:44:35.280 --> 02:44:38.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Then, you have to have the president's approval.

asr-001679
02:44:38.600 --> 02:44:39.760
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Then, NEDA approval.

asr-001680
02:44:39.900 --> 02:44:41.440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Then, now you can approve for the president.

asr-001681
02:44:41.640 --> 02:44:41.980
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001682
02:44:42.060 --> 02:44:43.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Oh, kasi general law kayo.

asr-001683
02:44:43.380 --> 02:44:45.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You can do that anywhere in the Philippines.

asr-001684
02:44:45.460 --> 02:44:48.440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Except where there is a special law.

asr-001685
02:44:49.040 --> 02:44:49.400
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001686
02:44:50.020 --> 02:44:54.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And assuming, assuming, assuming you want to challenge that right now.

asr-001687
02:44:55.040 --> 02:44:56.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Assuming, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001688
02:44:56.680 --> 02:44:59.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Assuming for the sake of order, whatever.

asr-001689
02:45:00.000 --> 02:45:16.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You think that you can do a better job. That's your call. Pero ano, apektohan yung public service ng mga parks, madi-delay yung pag-construct. So can you again show the picture of the Laguna Lake Highway?

asr-001690
02:45:16.240 --> 02:45:46.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Thank you very much. That's what I want to highlight, Mr. Chairman, Chairman Lopez. Walang problema kung every year nag-aaway kayo ng LLDA, eh siyempre inutos ng DPWH, kumuha na lang kayo ng permit sa ano. Pero kung 20 years na, 15 years na nagko-construct sa side namin at may problema ang PRA...

asr-001691
02:45:46.240 --> 02:45:53.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: LLDA, kahit kami ang maiipit sa gitna. Tapos ang DPWH na mas malaki ang project, hindi maiipit.

asr-001692
02:45:53.860 --> 02:46:05.320
PRA Chair Alex Lopez: Hindi naman po namin iniipit ang mga project po. We were just asked for their compliances according to our rules.

asr-001693
02:46:05.320 --> 02:46:15.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: That is if every single year ginagawa nyo. Sinasabi ko nga sa inyo, 20 years na may project yan, hindi naman kayo sumusulat doon.

asr-001694
02:46:15.320 --> 02:46:25.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Tapos pagsulat nyo ongoing yung project, hindi nyo ako tinanong. Dalawa senador na taga-tagig dyan, hindi nyo tinanong yung mayor, hindi nyo tinanong yung dalawang congressman.

asr-001695
02:46:26.020 --> 02:46:37.340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Tapos ang DPWH takot sumagot sa inyo. So hindi ba naipit? So ngayon, kung sa City of Manila, may project dyan na pinapakinabangan ng napakaraming tao, hindi private yan, public.

asr-001696
02:46:37.940 --> 02:46:44.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Because may dalawang ahensya na hindi magkasundo kung sino. Biglang matigil, hindi ba naipit yun?

asr-001697
02:46:45.320 --> 02:46:49.700
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: We will call their attention po to regularize.

asr-001698
02:46:49.700 --> 02:47:07.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes, sir. But sinis and desist eh. Wala namang additional reclamation. Kung pumunta lang kayo doon at inimbitahan namin lahat na pumunta doon at nakita nyo, pinapalitadahan lang yung isang project, hindi na kayo gumawa ng gulo at nag-issue ng cease and desist. Hindi ba?

asr-001699
02:47:08.520 --> 02:47:15.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kung nagpatawag kayo ng meeting ng DPWH at LLDA, kung inimbitahan nyo yung congressman doon sa lugar na yon,

asr-001700
02:47:15.320 --> 02:47:21.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: kung inimbitahan nyo yung local government, kung inimbitahan nyo yung mga barangay involved, nangyari pa ba itong lahat na to?

asr-001701
02:47:24.700 --> 02:47:36.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kung kapaligtarin ko, kung ganyan ko kayo ituring, hindi na dito tayo mag-usap, kung sa media ko nilabas itong lahat, every week, every ngan, magkakaintindihan ba tayo, sir?

asr-001702
02:47:37.360 --> 02:47:44.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yung project nyo, yung PIEC, kung hindi ko pakinggan ngayon at banatang ko na lang every week,

asr-001703
02:47:45.320 --> 02:47:52.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: tapos kawawa ang Pilipinas pag na-delay kasi maganda naman pala. Will you appreciate that, Mr. Chairman?

asr-001704
02:47:54.060 --> 02:48:06.260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Wala kaming problema kung may anomalya dyan, kung may titles. Sir, are you aware, sir, taga DNR, are you aware na napakaraming fake titles dyan?

asr-001705
02:48:07.080 --> 02:48:08.980
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: Totoo po yun, Mr. Your Honor.

asr-001706
02:48:09.500 --> 02:48:14.960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So what does myself, what does Mayor Lani, what does Taguig have to do?

asr-001707
02:48:15.320 --> 02:48:16.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kung may fake titles dyan.

asr-001708
02:48:19.280 --> 02:48:20.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sabi ni-imbestigahan nyo.

asr-001709
02:48:21.020 --> 02:48:24.680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di-imbestigahan nyo with LRA, wala kaming problema dun, sir.

asr-001710
02:48:27.720 --> 02:48:28.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Wala kaming problema dun.

asr-001711
02:48:29.860 --> 02:48:32.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O sabi nyo may nireclaim illegally, mapupunta sa gobyerno.

asr-001712
02:48:33.320 --> 02:48:35.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Lahat tunong makikita nyo dyan sa gobyerno eh.

asr-001713
02:48:35.840 --> 02:48:37.860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So ano ang kukunin nyo para sa gobyerno?

asr-001714
02:48:39.580 --> 02:48:42.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sir, sa interview nyo, paulit-ulit kayo, kukunin namin yan.

asr-001715
02:48:43.360 --> 02:48:45.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Anong kukunin nyo po? Eh sa gobyerno naman po.

asr-001716
02:48:45.320 --> 02:48:45.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Anong kukunin nyo po yan?

asr-001717
02:48:47.120 --> 02:48:51.660
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Your Honor, actually we're not stopping the construction.

asr-001718
02:48:53.120 --> 02:48:59.340
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: I just want to clarify, Your Honor, what we have questioned with the DPWH

asr-001719
02:48:59.340 --> 02:49:09.860
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: is the filling up of the area which is enclosed by the, with the slope protection and the C6.

asr-001720
02:49:10.340 --> 02:49:11.960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And you didn't explain it?

asr-001721
02:49:13.160 --> 02:49:14.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sir, eto ah.

asr-001722
02:49:15.320 --> 02:49:17.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ay Secretary Dizon ang nagpapaliwanag.

asr-001723
02:49:17.380 --> 02:49:18.340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Alam nyo po bakit, sir?

asr-001724
02:49:19.180 --> 02:49:22.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi nung panahon ni President Pinoy, chief of staff ko siya.

asr-001725
02:49:23.160 --> 02:49:24.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So familiar siya dyan.

asr-001726
02:49:25.300 --> 02:49:33.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nung panahon ni PRD, presidential advisor on flagship program siya.

asr-001727
02:49:33.780 --> 02:49:37.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At parati niyang kasama ang DOTR at DPWH.

asr-001728
02:49:37.480 --> 02:49:40.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At nandyan siya nung napag-usapan yung project.

asr-001729
02:49:40.760 --> 02:49:41.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kaya alam niya.

asr-001730
02:49:41.940 --> 02:49:44.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Eto, sir, na kulay blue at kulay pula.

asr-001731
02:49:44.660 --> 02:49:45.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yan ang re-alignance.

asr-001732
02:49:45.320 --> 02:49:51.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yan ang re-alignance ngayon dahil kailangan ilayo ng 1 kilometer from the lakeshore.

asr-001733
02:49:51.960 --> 02:49:56.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Because kung hindi, sir, yung 1,300 hectares namin aano rin na.

asr-001734
02:49:57.800 --> 02:50:03.680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At kung hindi gagawan ng lake ng park, sir, ano nangyayari pagka tapos tubig na?

asr-001735
02:50:03.840 --> 02:50:04.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: In your experience?

asr-001736
02:50:05.280 --> 02:50:05.720
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Erosion.

asr-001737
02:50:06.280 --> 02:50:09.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Aside from erosion, binabahayan, di ba, ng tao?

asr-001738
02:50:09.240 --> 02:50:09.560
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001739
02:50:09.960 --> 02:50:12.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Aside from binabahayan, tinatapo na ng basura, di ba, sir?

asr-001740
02:50:12.800 --> 02:50:13.200
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001741
02:50:13.200 --> 02:50:14.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero pag may park, sir?

asr-001742
02:50:15.320 --> 02:50:16.220
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001743
02:50:16.220 --> 02:50:17.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Completed na?

asr-001744
02:50:17.880 --> 02:50:18.860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Completed lahat, di ba, sir?

asr-001745
02:50:19.000 --> 02:50:21.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: May CR, walang nagda-dump sa tubig.

asr-001746
02:50:21.620 --> 02:50:22.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yan yung purpose niyon, sir.

asr-001747
02:50:22.820 --> 02:50:24.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang tawag diyan, linear park.

asr-001748
02:50:25.220 --> 02:50:30.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, I don't take it against anyone who wants to investigate, who asks, may project.

asr-001749
02:50:30.540 --> 02:50:34.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang hinihingi ko lang, Mr. Chairman, I'll, I'll, ano, dahil I'm taking up too much time.

asr-001750
02:50:35.820 --> 02:50:37.820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi pa pwede mag-usap yung gobyerno.

asr-001751
02:50:38.460 --> 02:50:39.220
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, we will, your honor.

asr-001752
02:50:39.220 --> 02:50:42.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, sa Friday, nandito si Secretary Vince Dizon.

asr-001753
02:50:42.600 --> 02:50:45.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Can someone of authority sa inyo attend?

asr-001754
02:50:45.320 --> 02:50:47.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Para kayo mag-usap?

asr-001755
02:50:47.900 --> 02:50:54.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: In front of all of us, para hindi kayo, di ba, he said this, he said this.

asr-001756
02:50:54.740 --> 02:50:55.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kaya kayo mag-usap.

asr-001757
02:50:56.420 --> 02:50:57.600
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Your honor, if I may?

asr-001758
02:50:57.600 --> 02:50:58.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes, go ahead.

asr-001759
02:50:58.800 --> 02:51:06.180
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Actually, tama po kayo kung, kung finilap nyo, hindi po matatamba ka ng basura.

asr-001760
02:51:06.860 --> 02:51:09.480
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Going back lang po doon sa 2018 incident,

asr-001761
02:51:10.060 --> 02:51:14.480
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: actually, ang una po namin na, na, na, stop.

asr-001762
02:51:15.320 --> 02:51:19.680
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Is a filling up doon sa portion nung dulo po, na may basura po.

asr-001763
02:51:20.260 --> 02:51:20.660
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

asr-001764
02:51:21.200 --> 02:51:30.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I don't know where I remember you from eh, but your name is very familiar or you just have one of those names that are nice and easy to pronounce and everything.

asr-001765
02:51:30.700 --> 02:51:33.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But, this goes to everyone.

asr-001766
02:51:33.860 --> 02:51:35.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi ba reputation is important?

asr-001767
02:51:36.940 --> 02:51:37.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di ba?

asr-001768
02:51:37.940 --> 02:51:43.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kaya kami ni Senator Tulfo nagbabanatan din minsan, pero, you know, we try to then, we talk.

asr-001769
02:51:43.600 --> 02:51:44.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Why?

asr-001770
02:51:44.480 --> 02:51:45.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: His reputation.

asr-001771
02:51:45.320 --> 02:51:46.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: is important to him.

asr-001772
02:51:46.300 --> 02:51:47.740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: My reputation is important to him.

asr-001773
02:51:48.560 --> 02:51:50.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Who will speak for the city of Taguig?

asr-001774
02:51:52.220 --> 02:51:59.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, pag sinabing may anomalya dyan, may titulo dyan, and this is dyan, et cetera, hindi po tao yung city eh.

asr-001775
02:52:00.180 --> 02:52:06.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kaya ko tinanong, chairman, di ba, kung Manila yun, whether official ka o hindi, pag sinabing Manila ganito, Manila ganyan.

asr-001776
02:52:07.580 --> 02:52:11.040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, yun ang problema, sir, kasi ang dami na sinabi about our city.

asr-001777
02:52:11.160 --> 02:52:15.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, like, halimbawa, sir, sa titling, no, I mean, maybe si engineer.

asr-001778
02:52:15.320 --> 02:52:21.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Does the city have any, any, ano, participation in land titling?

asr-001779
02:52:24.460 --> 02:52:33.520
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: Sa proseso po, your honor, ay kailangan po namin ng concurrence po ng, ano, halimbawa yung city po, katulad po ng nangyayari.

asr-001780
02:52:33.520 --> 02:52:41.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, but I'm saying, sir, di ba, if I'm a private, magpapatitulo ako, di ba, I either go to LRA or to court, di ba?

asr-001781
02:52:41.760 --> 02:52:42.020
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: Opo.

asr-001782
02:52:42.020 --> 02:52:42.060
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: Opo.

asr-001783
02:52:42.760 --> 02:52:44.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Wala namang participation yung city, di ba?

asr-001784
02:52:45.320 --> 02:52:47.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang city ba nagpapatitulo?

asr-001785
02:52:47.640 --> 02:52:53.200
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: Your honor, bahagi po ng proseso ng pagtitulo po ay yung kailangan po na may SOP yan.

asr-001786
02:52:53.780 --> 02:52:55.220
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: At kung ito ay pag-aay po.

asr-001787
02:52:55.400 --> 02:52:58.660
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sir, sabihin niyo yung SOP kasi sa media may ibang ibig sabihin ng SOP.

asr-001788
02:53:00.060 --> 02:53:00.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pakisabi, sir.

asr-001789
02:53:00.740 --> 02:53:01.440
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: Survey, survey po.

asr-001790
02:53:01.780 --> 02:53:02.380
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: May survey.

asr-001791
02:53:02.620 --> 02:53:03.180
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: May survey.

asr-001792
02:53:03.740 --> 02:53:07.880
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: At in-administer po ito ng lisensyado pong judetic engineer.

asr-001793
02:53:07.960 --> 02:53:08.680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes, not the city.

asr-001794
02:53:08.700 --> 02:53:09.620
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: So, gagawa po ng plano yan.

asr-001795
02:53:09.640 --> 02:53:10.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sir, not the city.

asr-001796
02:53:10.480 --> 02:53:11.600
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: At pag natapos po dito.

asr-001797
02:53:11.960 --> 02:53:12.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes.

asr-001798
02:53:12.220 --> 02:53:14.360
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: Of course po, may pipirman po ng city.

asr-001799
02:53:14.360 --> 02:53:15.620
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: Okay, kasi sa kanila po yung lupa.

asr-001800
02:53:16.420 --> 02:53:16.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sorry po.

asr-001801
02:53:17.300 --> 02:53:18.500
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: May pipirman po yung plano.

asr-001802
02:53:18.500 --> 02:53:18.740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, no.

asr-001803
02:53:19.100 --> 02:53:21.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You're talking about land that city owns.

asr-001804
02:53:21.920 --> 02:53:22.340
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: Yes po.

asr-001805
02:53:22.500 --> 02:53:24.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, I'm talking about land titling in general.

asr-001806
02:53:25.500 --> 02:53:26.140
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: Ganon din po.

asr-001807
02:53:26.600 --> 02:53:31.760
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: Yung plano po ng lupa, kailangan po pirmahan nila, mag-concur po sila sa ginawa po ng judetic engineer.

asr-001808
02:53:31.760 --> 02:53:32.660
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: So, may concurrence.

asr-001809
02:53:32.920 --> 02:53:38.360
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: At yun po ang isasabit natin doon po sa DINR po, sa Land Management Bureau.

asr-001810
02:53:38.620 --> 02:53:41.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sino ang pipirma sa city para sa land?

asr-001811
02:53:41.360 --> 02:53:42.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I have not.

asr-001812
02:53:43.240 --> 02:53:44.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi pa ako nagpapatitulo.

asr-001813
02:53:44.360 --> 02:53:45.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nagpapatitulo ng lupa.

asr-001814
02:53:46.860 --> 02:53:57.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sa media kasi, it's being communicated na para bang ang city ang gumagawa ng titlo.

asr-001815
02:53:57.960 --> 02:54:06.900
PRA General Manager and CEO Cesar S. Siador Jr.: Your Honor, as per advice po na kasama ko, na dati ko rin kasamahan sa DINR, ay yung assessor po ang normally pumipirma po para sa titlo po ng lupa.

asr-001816
02:54:06.900 --> 02:54:12.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes, because the assessor, if you do not have a title yet, but you're paying the taxes,

asr-001817
02:54:12.620 --> 02:54:15.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: then you will get the tax deck.

asr-001818
02:54:16.320 --> 02:54:16.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Diba?

asr-001819
02:54:16.840 --> 02:54:24.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And if you go, for example, sa Fort Bonifacio, nung binenta yan, there were several having tax decks for the same lupa.

asr-001820
02:54:25.800 --> 02:54:27.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ganon din, may mga fake titles nun.

asr-001821
02:54:27.860 --> 02:54:27.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Diba?

asr-001822
02:54:29.420 --> 02:54:37.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, what I'm saying is that, if you're saying they're part of the process in the sense that you have to get the tax deck and you have to sign,

asr-001823
02:54:38.980 --> 02:54:39.100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: diba?

asr-001824
02:54:39.100 --> 02:54:42.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But, regardless, itabi mo yan.

asr-001825
02:54:42.620 --> 02:54:45.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, what does the city have to do kung may mga titlo dun?

asr-001826
02:54:47.600 --> 02:54:49.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Familiar ba kayo ng land titling sa Laguna Lake?

asr-001827
02:54:50.480 --> 02:54:52.100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: This is the second to my final, ano.

asr-001828
02:54:52.440 --> 02:54:58.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sir, are you familiar with the land titlings upon the Laguna Lake area?

asr-001829
02:54:59.500 --> 02:55:00.260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di po, sir.

asr-001830
02:55:00.300 --> 02:55:03.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. I will familiarize you guys, para lang malinaw, pati sa media.

asr-001831
02:55:04.880 --> 02:55:07.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: 60s, 70s, napasay yung Laguna Lake, diba?

asr-001832
02:55:08.280 --> 02:55:11.840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Martial law, pwede kang PD, presidential decree.

asr-001833
02:55:12.620 --> 02:55:14.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang PD is the effect of law.

asr-001834
02:55:15.820 --> 02:55:17.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Diba? Because of Proclamation No. 3.

asr-001835
02:55:18.260 --> 02:55:18.400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-001836
02:55:18.920 --> 02:55:25.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sabi sa LLDA law, pag mababa sa 12.5 meters, automatically, it is owned by LLDA.

asr-001837
02:55:25.840 --> 02:55:27.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: It's under their jurisdiction.

asr-001838
02:55:27.880 --> 02:55:29.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At pag may lupa dun, sa kanila yun.

asr-001839
02:55:30.260 --> 02:55:30.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nasa law yun.

asr-001840
02:55:31.940 --> 02:55:36.820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero, even under PD 3, even under martial law, may constitution tayo.

asr-001841
02:55:37.280 --> 02:55:41.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And the constitution says, you cannot take land without payment.

asr-001842
02:55:41.000 --> 02:55:42.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, any...

asr-001843
02:55:42.620 --> 02:55:48.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Anyone who already had title nun, ay hindi pwedeng kunin ng LLDA unless babayaran nila.

asr-001844
02:55:48.980 --> 02:55:50.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Diba? Kasi may title ka na eh.

asr-001845
02:55:50.920 --> 02:55:52.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, isang tabi na natin yun.

asr-001846
02:55:52.340 --> 02:55:55.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yung mga may title before the LLDA law.

asr-001847
02:55:55.800 --> 02:55:56.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-001848
02:55:56.500 --> 02:55:58.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: After that, nasubaybayan ko yan over the years.

asr-001849
02:55:59.500 --> 02:56:01.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: 1992, I was 21 years old.

asr-001850
02:56:01.560 --> 02:56:02.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Conceal na ako sa tagi.

asr-001851
02:56:03.240 --> 02:56:09.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang nangyayari dyan usually, pag may nag-file sa RTC for title,

asr-001852
02:56:09.760 --> 02:56:11.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: kwe-question yun ng LLDA dahil sa batas nila.

asr-001853
02:56:12.620 --> 02:56:20.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But, pag na-prove nung may-ari na sa kanya yun at na-grant ng RTC,

asr-001854
02:56:20.920 --> 02:56:22.960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: nung araw, inaabot pa ng Supreme Court.

asr-001855
02:56:23.400 --> 02:56:26.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But, I don't know when, if it was 80s or 90s,

asr-001856
02:56:27.160 --> 02:56:28.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: naging desisyon ng LLDA,

asr-001857
02:56:29.040 --> 02:56:31.680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: pag nanalo sa RTC, huwag na natin habulin hanggang Supreme Court.

asr-001858
02:56:32.540 --> 02:56:34.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi, talo na tayo sa RTC.

asr-001859
02:56:34.800 --> 02:56:38.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, meron talagang mga titulo dyan.

asr-001860
02:56:38.500 --> 02:56:40.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Again, I ask the question,

asr-001861
02:56:40.740 --> 02:56:42.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: unless yung city ang nagpapasili...

asr-001862
02:56:42.620 --> 02:56:46.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: What does the city have to do with all the titles there?

asr-001863
02:56:46.480 --> 02:56:47.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kaya, nasabi ko sa media,

asr-001864
02:56:49.020 --> 02:56:53.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: kung babawiin nyo lahat ng titulo ng lahat sa Laguna Lake,

asr-001865
02:56:53.260 --> 02:56:55.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: pabor sa amin yun kasi gobyerno ngayon yun.

asr-001866
02:56:55.780 --> 02:56:57.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero, magkakagulo tayo sa lahat ng...

asr-001867
02:56:58.560 --> 02:57:00.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: sa Torrens title.

asr-001868
02:57:00.860 --> 02:57:03.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi, yung iba dyan, 20, 30, 40 years,

asr-001869
02:57:03.480 --> 02:57:04.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: puwera yung fake.

asr-001870
02:57:05.200 --> 02:57:06.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yung fake at any time,

asr-001871
02:57:10.620 --> 02:57:11.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: ano ba ang...

asr-001872
02:57:11.620 --> 02:57:11.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: ang...

asr-001873
02:57:11.880 --> 02:57:13.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: pagka-fraudulent yung title?

asr-001874
02:57:14.700 --> 02:57:15.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Dalawa, di ba?

asr-001875
02:57:15.540 --> 02:57:17.920
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pagka yung fake, as in it's hindi totoo,

asr-001876
02:57:18.800 --> 02:57:19.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: any time yun.

asr-001877
02:57:19.740 --> 02:57:20.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Wala yun.

asr-001878
02:57:20.400 --> 02:57:20.760
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Wala yun.

asr-001879
02:57:21.280 --> 02:57:22.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: It's null and void.

asr-001880
02:57:22.780 --> 02:57:23.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di ba?

asr-001881
02:57:23.540 --> 02:57:25.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero, if you have a real title,

asr-001882
02:57:25.300 --> 02:57:27.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: but through fraudulent means,

asr-001883
02:57:27.720 --> 02:57:28.260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: nakuha mo,

asr-001884
02:57:29.140 --> 02:57:29.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: is it four years?

asr-001885
02:57:30.140 --> 02:57:31.440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Four years from discovery?

asr-001886
02:57:31.760 --> 02:57:33.740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Isa sa inyo is a broker, eh.

asr-001887
02:57:33.800 --> 02:57:34.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nakita ko sa...

asr-001888
02:57:34.980 --> 02:57:35.660
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: sa ano nyo.

asr-001889
02:57:35.740 --> 02:57:37.260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sino yung broker sa...

asr-001890
02:57:37.260 --> 02:57:38.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Isa sa board nyo...

asr-001891
02:57:38.420 --> 02:57:38.760
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi, oh.

asr-001892
02:57:38.840 --> 02:57:41.860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Mr. El Defonso is the director of the Bureau of Land,

asr-001893
02:57:41.980 --> 02:57:43.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: for the longest of time.

asr-001894
02:57:43.120 --> 02:57:44.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, maybe you can answer.

